WEBVTT

01:26.100 --> 01:31.730
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.140 --> 01:39.560
[Episode 5: Tumults in Nandu]

01:40.770 --> 01:44.289
[Luo Family's Village]

02:17.620 --> 02:20.240
It seems that those people will find you.

02:21.750 --> 02:23.340
Are you scared?

02:24.880 --> 02:26.840
You should be.

02:28.900 --> 02:30.386
They will find you.

02:30.410 --> 02:31.736
Are you scared?

02:31.760 --> 02:33.840
You should be.

02:34.500 --> 02:35.950
Luo Wenjia.

02:42.200 --> 02:43.650
Did you have a nightmare?

02:45.800 --> 02:47.250
No.

02:52.210 --> 02:53.660
Wipe your sweat.

03:05.280 --> 03:06.930
How long have I been asleep?

03:07.090 --> 03:08.690
Are we almost there?

03:09.370 --> 03:10.820
Yes.

03:25.090 --> 03:27.880
[Jiang's Restaurant]

03:29.560 --> 03:31.156
Tang Xiao's two guards

03:31.180 --> 03:32.730
are indeed capable warriors.

03:33.090 --> 03:34.700
The male guard is Zhong.

03:34.820 --> 03:36.656
I've never seen him fight before,

03:36.680 --> 03:39.590
so I don't know his specific fighting style.

03:39.980 --> 03:41.980
But I think he's Japanese.

03:42.770 --> 03:44.220
Why?

03:44.300 --> 03:45.366
Last year,

03:45.390 --> 03:48.416
some veterans from the government

03:48.440 --> 03:50.230
smashed up one of the Tang family's shops.

03:50.360 --> 03:52.086
They were found dead at the riverside that night.

03:52.110 --> 03:54.300
Their swords were all cleaved.

03:54.330 --> 03:56.366
The cuts on their armor were clean.

03:56.390 --> 03:58.576
Those were typically caused by Japanese swordsmen.

03:58.600 --> 03:59.816
Tang Xiao killed those soldiers.

03:59.840 --> 04:01.076
How come no one was after him?

04:01.100 --> 04:02.236
There was not enough evidence.

04:02.260 --> 04:03.426
And Tang Xiao

04:03.450 --> 04:05.530
has many connections in the government.

04:05.580 --> 04:07.586
Therefore, the government killed several prisoners as scapegoats.

04:07.610 --> 04:09.060
That's all.

04:09.390 --> 04:10.826
What about the other guard?

04:10.850 --> 04:13.350
She dresses quite differently from us.

04:14.450 --> 04:15.876
Her name is Meizhu.

04:15.900 --> 04:18.116
It is said that she was born in the far north.

04:18.140 --> 04:20.100
I even fought with her once.

04:21.940 --> 04:23.390
You?

04:32.049 --> 04:33.820
This happened three years ago.

04:34.070 --> 04:35.796
Back then, there was a man called Li Baiwan.

04:35.820 --> 04:37.860
He was known as the best needle user.

04:38.100 --> 04:39.706
He had a grudge against Tang Xiao,

04:39.730 --> 04:41.930
so he summoned his men to fight Tang Xiao.

04:45.570 --> 04:47.020
You don't like the story?

04:47.620 --> 04:49.400
No, no. Continue.

04:53.630 --> 04:56.086
Meizhu is good at using blunt weapons

04:56.110 --> 04:59.046
and the method of martial arts she uses is unique.

04:59.070 --> 04:59.836
Anyway,

04:59.860 --> 05:01.376
she has something wrapped around her hands and arms.

05:01.400 --> 05:02.386
Her attacking style is overbearing.

05:02.410 --> 05:03.916
She's very strong.

05:03.940 --> 05:05.326
But her movements are not sophisticated.

05:05.350 --> 05:06.430
Even though she was attacked by a group of warriors,

05:06.430 --> 05:08.780
she stayed unhurt.

05:09.100 --> 05:10.720
How about Li Baiwan?

05:10.780 --> 05:12.326
He went all out.

05:12.350 --> 05:15.360
He used his Three Meteor Shower Moves.

05:17.160 --> 05:20.460
Immediately, needles flew in the air, cutting raindrops and breaking stones,

05:20.730 --> 05:24.440
just like the falling stars.

05:25.350 --> 05:26.576
How did Meizhu react?

05:26.600 --> 05:28.726
She just used her arms to cover her eyes.

05:28.750 --> 05:30.736
She wasn't afraid of his needles at all.

05:30.760 --> 05:32.520
Li Baiwan gave an evil grin.

05:33.080 --> 05:36.160
He looked like a demon.

05:57.230 --> 05:59.346
She's really a top warrior.

05:59.370 --> 06:01.130
Without any hesitation, I used

06:04.500 --> 06:06.286
my Wandering Step,

06:06.310 --> 06:08.560
jumping off from three stories high.

06:18.560 --> 06:20.756
She was so immersed in killing

06:20.780 --> 06:22.840
and attacked me without any reason.

06:22.950 --> 06:26.390
I used the Dragon Sword to dissolve her momentum.

06:26.930 --> 06:28.810
I was not afraid of her at all.

06:29.430 --> 06:30.376
Anyway,

06:30.400 --> 06:32.476
if you don't fight with her yourself,

06:32.500 --> 06:34.530
you won't understand how strong she is.

06:34.580 --> 06:36.696
You can't figure it out by only watching.

06:36.720 --> 06:38.860
If you consider that as "fighting with her",

06:38.900 --> 06:41.510
I can brag I conquered the martial world.

06:42.170 --> 06:44.370
At least I had a combat with her.

06:45.060 --> 06:46.025
Then,

06:46.049 --> 06:47.616
how will you compare Meizhu and Zhong

06:47.640 --> 06:49.510
to Qi Tianfeng?

06:50.410 --> 06:51.766
Qi Tianfeng?

06:51.790 --> 06:53.296
He's really a top martial artist.

06:53.320 --> 06:55.076
He's known as the Iron Hand Demon.

06:55.100 --> 06:58.186
His Twelve Wave-breaking Palms are almost invincible in Nandu.

06:58.210 --> 07:00.316
But all these years of fighting

07:00.340 --> 07:01.566
left him injured.

07:01.590 --> 07:04.500
I've never heard him fight with anyone again.

07:04.560 --> 07:06.260
Why are you asking about Qi Tianfeng?

07:09.650 --> 07:11.780
Qi Tianfeng is famous.

07:12.050 --> 07:13.536
By comparing your fight with Meizhu

07:13.560 --> 07:14.816
and your fight with Qi Tianfeng,

07:14.840 --> 07:16.770
Miss Shu can know how good you are.

07:23.010 --> 07:26.006
If I want to fight with Qi Tianfeng,

07:26.030 --> 07:27.480
I have to practice for a few more years.

07:28.510 --> 07:30.310
According to what you just said,

07:31.200 --> 07:33.556
Tang Xiao has always been unruly.

07:33.580 --> 07:35.086
We bought Liansheng House.

07:35.110 --> 07:36.456
Won't he hate us?

07:36.480 --> 07:37.796
Don't worry.

07:37.820 --> 07:39.216
No matter how arrogant Tang Xiao is,

07:39.240 --> 07:40.916
he doesn't dare to provoke the Su family,

07:40.940 --> 07:43.530
let alone my friends.

07:51.350 --> 07:54.080
Friends? That's very nice of you.

07:55.330 --> 07:56.726
Sir.

07:56.750 --> 07:58.006
Here.

07:58.030 --> 07:59.586
We had some misunderstandings.

07:59.610 --> 08:01.256
But now I know you are a righteous man.

08:01.280 --> 08:04.200
Although you don't know martial arts, you have a warrior's heart.

08:04.540 --> 08:05.990
Here.

08:12.550 --> 08:14.000
That's enough.

08:14.210 --> 08:15.840
Cut the crap.

08:16.080 --> 08:17.416
Let's get down to business.

08:17.440 --> 08:18.286
That's right.

08:18.310 --> 08:19.836
How can I forget such an important thing?

08:19.860 --> 08:20.736
Mr. Yun,

08:20.760 --> 08:22.986
I've handed my 3,000 taels to the Chamber of Commerce.

08:23.010 --> 08:24.396
When you fill in the other 3,000 taels,

08:24.420 --> 08:26.230
we can get the deed.

08:27.750 --> 08:30.410
What's the deadline for that?

08:32.500 --> 08:34.089
What do you mean?

08:34.480 --> 08:35.636
Can't you understand?

08:35.660 --> 08:37.579
Does he look like he's rich?

08:38.480 --> 08:40.520
I'm just asking about the time.

08:42.410 --> 08:43.785
As stipulated by the Chamber of Commerce,

08:43.809 --> 08:46.000
all procedures should be done before five.

08:46.130 --> 08:48.206
The deal will be canceled after five o'clock

08:48.230 --> 08:50.180
and the already paid-in will not be returned.

08:50.280 --> 08:51.730
Five o'clock.

08:51.900 --> 08:53.546
It's already past one now.

08:53.570 --> 08:55.220
Only four hours left.

09:02.740 --> 09:04.540
Do you have 3,000 taels?

09:07.420 --> 09:09.580
I'm paid to protect him.

09:09.740 --> 09:11.190
Please forgive me.

09:18.080 --> 09:20.346
There are still four hours left.

09:20.370 --> 09:21.806
Mr. Su,

09:21.830 --> 09:22.986
don't jump to conclusions.

09:23.010 --> 09:24.596
There are only four hours left.

09:24.620 --> 09:25.846
How can I trust you?

09:25.870 --> 09:28.170
You don't have other choices now.

09:29.570 --> 09:31.506
Mr. Su, please calm down.

09:31.530 --> 09:33.526
You can take a rest in the Chamber of Commerce.

09:33.550 --> 09:35.926
I will get the money

09:35.950 --> 09:37.400
and send it to the Chamber of Commerce in time.

09:44.200 --> 09:47.200
Okay, I'll wait for you.

10:05.020 --> 10:06.470
Waiter.

10:06.980 --> 10:08.430
I have a task for you.

10:09.370 --> 10:10.556
I'll tell you a place.

10:10.580 --> 10:13.316
Send the food on the table and this

10:13.340 --> 10:14.790
to that place.

10:14.980 --> 10:16.620
Okay, thank you.

10:22.220 --> 10:23.766
Su Mingyu

10:23.790 --> 10:25.406
talked a good game about martial arts,

10:25.430 --> 10:27.440
but he's just a lightweight.

10:27.480 --> 10:28.636
I tried him just now.

10:28.660 --> 10:30.110
He immediately flinched.

10:30.840 --> 10:32.290
He's just like you.

10:32.540 --> 10:34.650
Only 30% of what you say is true.

10:35.380 --> 10:36.386
30%?

10:36.410 --> 10:38.490
I'd say you think too highly of me.

10:38.980 --> 10:41.520
None of you is completely honest.

10:42.810 --> 10:44.260
How about this?

10:44.930 --> 10:46.406
We terminate our agreement.

10:46.430 --> 10:48.780
I'll take a few orders to make some money.

10:49.700 --> 10:51.930
Then I'll pay you back, okay?

11:02.300 --> 11:03.870
Will you leave

11:04.220 --> 11:05.670
when you complete your revenge?

11:05.800 --> 11:07.250
Of course.

11:12.940 --> 11:14.156
What's wrong?

11:14.180 --> 11:16.880
Nothing. I was just asking.

11:17.780 --> 11:19.700
Every sentence you say

11:19.870 --> 11:21.570
has a purpose.

11:26.450 --> 11:27.900
What?

11:29.360 --> 11:30.186
What?

11:30.210 --> 11:31.660
Come here.

11:37.800 --> 11:39.250
What do you want to do?

11:46.400 --> 11:48.920
Don't mention Qi Tianfeng

11:49.170 --> 11:51.030
in front of Su Mingyu again.

11:52.570 --> 11:54.576
I can see you intentionally interrupted me.

11:54.600 --> 11:57.560
But I don't know why.

11:57.820 --> 12:02.216
Think about this. Meizhu once fought Su Mingyu.

12:02.240 --> 12:03.546
Why didn't Tang Xiao, who is so unruly,

12:03.570 --> 12:05.730
kill Su Mingyu?

12:07.360 --> 12:09.476
He must be afraid of the Su family's status.

12:09.500 --> 12:10.906
Yes.

12:10.930 --> 12:12.746
What else did you notice

12:12.770 --> 12:14.250
during the auction?

12:15.050 --> 12:17.870
Although Tang Xiao was humiliated,

12:17.930 --> 12:20.876
he didn't offend Su Mingyu.

12:20.900 --> 12:23.520
It can be seen that the Su family has a high status.

12:25.300 --> 12:27.446
So, we are not only using Su Mingyu

12:27.470 --> 12:29.270
to help us cross the river.

12:30.480 --> 12:31.626
I didn't want to say this.

12:31.650 --> 12:33.110
But I'm really afraid that you'll be too impatient

12:33.130 --> 12:34.650
and let the cat out of the bag.

12:34.910 --> 12:36.776
But thanks to my question,

12:36.800 --> 12:39.066
at least I know that Qi Tianfeng is suffering from old injuries

12:39.090 --> 12:40.810
and he's not as powerful as he used to be.

12:40.890 --> 12:43.230
Using force is not the only way to achieve revenge.

12:43.260 --> 12:44.756
At this point, I can tell you

12:44.780 --> 12:46.290
I'm only one step away

12:46.650 --> 12:48.516
from finishing my plan.

12:48.540 --> 12:49.990
Trust me.

12:52.500 --> 12:54.166
Get the 3,000 taels

12:54.190 --> 12:56.190
in four hours first.

12:59.070 --> 13:00.520
Sit back.

13:02.400 --> 13:03.850
You sit over there.

13:05.140 --> 13:07.110
I want to show you something.

13:07.290 --> 13:08.970
It's very important.

13:57.170 --> 13:58.620
We're here.

14:10.660 --> 14:13.016
[Guanghui Bank]

14:12.590 --> 14:14.270
Wait here for a moment.

14:14.470 --> 14:15.596
Godfather is gone.

14:15.620 --> 14:16.630
You want to get 3,000 taels

14:16.650 --> 14:18.770
with those invoices?

14:19.560 --> 14:22.000
Maybe. Maybe not.

14:22.740 --> 14:25.996
So mysterious. I don't believe you can.

14:26.020 --> 14:28.346
I think he just wants to buy time.

14:28.370 --> 14:29.820
It's a mere formality.

14:38.710 --> 14:40.160
Jin.

14:40.290 --> 14:41.726
You wanna bet?

14:41.750 --> 14:42.976
Bet?

14:43.000 --> 14:43.806
On what?

14:43.830 --> 14:45.036
If I can't get 3,000 taels

14:45.060 --> 14:47.196
within two hours,

14:47.220 --> 14:49.840
you and I will be even.

14:51.230 --> 14:52.950
Don't fall for his trick.

14:57.610 --> 14:59.260
Do you have money deposited here?

14:59.680 --> 15:00.236
No.

15:00.260 --> 15:01.386
Do you have any mortgageable property?

15:01.410 --> 15:02.860
No.

15:03.330 --> 15:05.860
You know any rich men in Nandu?

15:06.810 --> 15:09.730
Only one. Su Mingyu.

15:10.170 --> 15:11.620
Fine.

15:11.720 --> 15:13.286
If you get 3,000 taels,

15:13.310 --> 15:15.076
I'll work for you for several more months.

15:15.100 --> 15:16.476
If you can't,

15:16.500 --> 15:18.820
we'll be even.

15:19.930 --> 15:21.380
Deal.

15:30.530 --> 15:31.980
Don't shake your head for him.

15:35.870 --> 15:38.506
You ask me for 3,000 taels of silver

15:38.530 --> 15:41.086
with these old papers?

15:41.110 --> 15:42.076
Ridiculous!

15:42.100 --> 15:43.660
Mr. Wen is gone.

15:43.810 --> 15:45.446
His assets should belong to Yuntai Sect.

15:45.470 --> 15:46.150
But most of them

15:46.170 --> 15:48.490
are now in your hands.

15:48.670 --> 15:50.316
What do you think Master will do

15:50.340 --> 15:51.790
if he knows about this?

16:09.290 --> 16:10.740
Mr. Mo,

16:10.770 --> 16:12.246
even if you've only taken back

16:12.270 --> 16:13.826
70% of the loans Mr. Wen gave out,

16:13.850 --> 16:15.650
that's tens of thousands of taels.

16:16.120 --> 16:18.280
Even if I have tens of millions of taels,

16:18.660 --> 16:20.340
it has nothing to do with you.

16:20.460 --> 16:22.026
You came to Nandu without permission

16:22.050 --> 16:24.070
and intervened in Wen Cong's affairs.

16:24.100 --> 16:25.016
Yun Xiang.

16:25.040 --> 16:27.616
I don't want to make you look bad

16:27.640 --> 16:30.500
because you're Master's direct disciple.

16:31.650 --> 16:33.140
Without permission?

16:33.690 --> 16:35.716
Does that mean I need your permission

16:35.740 --> 16:38.036
to come to Nandu?

16:38.060 --> 16:40.226
Master asked you to take care of things in Yuezhou.

16:40.250 --> 16:43.186
He never sent you here to make Wen Cong your business.

16:43.210 --> 16:45.850
You're really well-informed.

16:45.960 --> 16:47.326
Yun Xiang.

16:47.350 --> 16:48.920
I'm being nice.

16:49.080 --> 16:51.286
Don't push your luck.

16:51.310 --> 16:54.350
Are you trying to blackmail me?

16:54.770 --> 16:56.650
Behave yourself.

16:59.740 --> 17:01.676
If I don't give you the 3,000 taels,

17:01.700 --> 17:02.620
will you report me to Master,

17:02.640 --> 17:03.756
accusing me of embezzlement?

17:03.780 --> 17:05.170
Are you going to say I'm looking on

17:05.190 --> 17:06.869
when Master's property is at risk?

17:07.880 --> 17:08.866
Brat.

17:08.890 --> 17:10.170
I've been working hard for the sect

17:10.190 --> 17:11.836
in Nandu for many years.

17:11.860 --> 17:14.006
So what if you're Master's direct disciple?

17:14.030 --> 17:15.836
You can't say Master trust me or you more.

17:15.860 --> 17:17.485
Let's each write a letter to him

17:17.509 --> 17:19.240
and see who he trusts.

17:21.170 --> 17:22.620
Why are you smiling?

17:24.459 --> 17:27.760
Mr. Mo, you and I are the same kind of people.

17:27.830 --> 17:29.640
I want power and you want money.

17:36.300 --> 17:38.396
I already know your intention.

17:38.420 --> 17:40.330
What's that about?

17:43.110 --> 17:44.560
A 5% monthly interest rate.

17:46.710 --> 17:48.716
I borrow 3,000 taels from you

17:48.740 --> 17:49.506
at an interest rate of 5%.

17:49.530 --> 17:51.170
I'll pay you back in a month.

17:58.700 --> 18:00.150
What about 10%?

18:03.770 --> 18:06.380
I can see you're truly desperate.

18:06.450 --> 18:08.800
Even 10% is not intriguing enough to you?

18:10.050 --> 18:11.500
How about this?

18:12.380 --> 18:14.280
For every tael I borrow, I'll pay you ten back.

18:16.800 --> 18:18.860
If I can't pay you back within a month,

18:19.190 --> 18:21.100
I'm at your disposal.

18:26.970 --> 18:28.580
Why hasn't he come out yet?

18:31.570 --> 18:34.500
We can take bets as well. What do you think?

18:35.290 --> 18:36.900
I don't think you stand a chance.

18:52.170 --> 18:55.210
I didn't expect to part ways with you so suddenly.

18:55.350 --> 18:57.790
Goodbye, Yun Xiang.

18:59.240 --> 19:01.080
Are you really leaving?

19:01.490 --> 19:02.716
A bet is a bet.

19:02.740 --> 19:04.850
See you.

19:05.200 --> 19:06.316
If you leave,

19:06.340 --> 19:08.110
I'll be in danger without your protection.

19:10.880 --> 19:12.790
You still have Shu Yanan.

19:13.290 --> 19:13.886
Jin,

19:13.910 --> 19:14.750
you are the real hero

19:14.770 --> 19:16.830
in my heart.

19:23.840 --> 19:24.986
Well...

19:25.010 --> 19:26.460
Mr. Yun.

19:28.850 --> 19:29.886
Mr. Yun.

19:29.910 --> 19:31.550
This is from Mr. Mo.

19:46.950 --> 19:49.150
You don't want to leave me, right?

19:54.070 --> 19:55.640
Seeing you shaking your head is annoying.

19:56.830 --> 19:58.280
Bite me!

20:03.920 --> 20:07.300
Mr. Mo of Guanghui Bank is also on your side?

20:08.320 --> 20:09.770
That's not what matters.

20:09.970 --> 20:11.580
What matters is that it's a money house.

20:14.300 --> 20:16.140
Did you borrow the money?

20:16.300 --> 20:17.900
You have assets that can be mortgaged?

20:19.860 --> 20:21.660
I promised to pay ten times back.

20:21.760 --> 20:23.136
What else should I mortgage?

20:23.160 --> 20:24.756
Ten times?

20:24.780 --> 20:27.140
That means you have to repay 30,000 taels.

20:27.940 --> 20:29.940
In a month

20:32.600 --> 20:33.966
You are too bold.

20:33.990 --> 20:35.506
I just want to make it quick.

20:35.530 --> 20:37.480
Tell me what your next move is.

20:37.920 --> 20:41.140
There's something I need your help with.

20:48.560 --> 20:50.006
Uncle, it's true that

20:50.030 --> 20:52.286
some of Wen Cong's debt has been paid.

20:52.310 --> 20:52.950
But I remember

20:52.970 --> 20:54.830
because of the money he owed us back then,

20:54.830 --> 20:55.886
you almost closed your business.

20:55.910 --> 20:58.750
Why didn't you tell Yun Xiang about this?

20:59.100 --> 21:00.666
Would it help?

21:00.690 --> 21:01.696
Would he believe it?

21:01.720 --> 21:03.626
Yun Xiang bought Liansheng House with six thousand taels.

21:03.650 --> 21:06.810
To pay for that, he promised to pay you ten times back.

21:07.060 --> 21:09.580
He is really strange.

21:09.760 --> 21:11.310
Anyway,

21:11.370 --> 21:13.990
if he repays 30,000 taels as promised,

21:14.110 --> 21:16.270
it will be an unexpected fortune.

21:16.300 --> 21:17.566
What if he can't pay it back?

21:17.590 --> 21:19.160
Will he really leave Nandu?

21:21.390 --> 21:23.406
I can't see through him yet.

21:23.430 --> 21:25.310
But after this,

21:25.540 --> 21:28.820
we can't be friends.

21:31.990 --> 21:33.546
That's all.

21:33.570 --> 21:34.596
Okay.

21:34.620 --> 21:35.596
After you go back,

21:35.620 --> 21:37.386
thank Warrior Jin for me.

21:37.410 --> 21:38.170
Thank you for your trouble.

21:38.190 --> 21:40.740
We won't walk you out then.

21:41.440 --> 21:43.250
May I use the toilet?

21:59.390 --> 22:01.890
Isn't there supposed to be more than ten kids?

22:05.610 --> 22:06.776
Uncle.

22:06.800 --> 22:09.530
Please take me with you.

22:14.520 --> 22:15.586
Little girl,

22:15.610 --> 22:17.150
what's wrong with you?

22:32.240 --> 22:33.780
So troublesome.

22:34.470 --> 22:35.920
Dear.

22:39.840 --> 22:42.366
I don't think Jin Biao

22:42.390 --> 22:43.946
will leave Nandu soon.

22:43.970 --> 22:45.726
It will be a problem if someone else comes again.

22:45.750 --> 22:47.746
Let's leave then.

22:47.770 --> 22:49.336
We can do our business anywhere.

22:49.360 --> 22:50.216
Coward!

22:50.240 --> 22:52.000
Even if we run away from Jin Biao today,

22:52.240 --> 22:54.636
there is always someone else after us.

22:54.660 --> 22:56.110
Then should we keep running?

22:57.230 --> 22:58.070
It's not the first time that

22:58.090 --> 23:00.520
a swordsman has targeted us.

23:01.780 --> 23:04.650
[Nandu Chamber of Commerce]

23:17.190 --> 23:18.986
Who knows how long he'll be in there.

23:19.010 --> 23:20.426
Why don't you take a rest in the carriage?

23:20.450 --> 23:22.120
I'll find a place to drink.

23:23.160 --> 23:24.720
You wait here.

23:24.750 --> 23:26.200
I have something to do.

23:29.240 --> 23:31.900
I've counted all the six thousand taels.

23:32.760 --> 23:35.226
This is the deed of Liansheng House.

23:35.250 --> 23:36.730
Please have a look.

23:39.380 --> 23:40.866
If there is no problem,

23:40.890 --> 23:43.610
you can sign it.

23:52.790 --> 23:56.030
Qian, please stamp the official seal of the Chamber of Commerce.

23:58.660 --> 24:01.066
Then come with me to the room inside.

24:01.090 --> 24:03.080
The chairman is waiting for you too.

24:21.970 --> 24:23.420
It's done.

24:30.270 --> 24:31.086
Sister,

24:31.110 --> 24:33.870
you look thinner.

24:34.900 --> 24:36.780
You've been avoiding me

24:36.890 --> 24:40.440
since you came back from Yangzhou.

24:42.010 --> 24:44.736
Liansheng House is not worth 6,000 taels.

24:44.760 --> 24:45.566
I know that. But...

24:45.590 --> 24:47.040
Let's not talk about this.

24:48.600 --> 24:50.050
Mingyu,

24:50.550 --> 24:52.270
are you serious about that girl?

24:52.340 --> 24:53.976
You insisted on buying Liansheng House

24:54.000 --> 24:55.806
because you want to give that girl

24:55.830 --> 24:57.610
a place to stay?

25:01.930 --> 25:05.160
Yes. I mean it.

25:06.010 --> 25:08.130
I only care about her.

25:08.600 --> 25:11.280
I'm a commoner and she's not. Our marriage is not allowed.

25:11.810 --> 25:14.830
I'll find a way to make her a commoner.

25:14.860 --> 25:17.556
It's not an easy thing.

25:17.580 --> 25:21.146
What do you plan to do now?

25:21.170 --> 25:24.740
For now, I can only keep her from being bullied by Tang Xiao.

25:25.820 --> 25:27.900
No other specific plans have been made.

25:33.090 --> 25:34.540
I can help you.

25:38.080 --> 25:39.650
Are you okay with it?

25:42.160 --> 25:44.196
I've been strict with you

25:44.220 --> 25:47.516
because I worried it's just a spur-of-the-moment thing to you.

25:47.540 --> 25:51.250
But I've seen what you did in the past two years.

25:51.670 --> 25:55.096
It's a good thing if you have someone in your heart.

25:55.120 --> 25:57.606
It would be a pity

25:57.630 --> 25:59.470
if you can't spend more time together

25:59.890 --> 26:01.740
just because of differences in social status.

26:03.760 --> 26:06.296
But you have to promise me one thing.

26:06.320 --> 26:07.246
What is it?

26:07.270 --> 26:09.396
I can help Miss Ke to be a commoner.

26:09.420 --> 26:14.950
But you need to learn to do business.

26:15.090 --> 26:16.776
Because in the future,

26:16.800 --> 26:18.960
you have to take care of the business of our family.

26:19.550 --> 26:23.170
[Liansheng House]

26:25.740 --> 26:27.190
Mr. Su.

26:28.200 --> 26:29.650
You're home.

26:34.450 --> 26:36.766
You bought Liansheng House as you wished.

26:36.790 --> 26:38.800
You can win her heart with that. Why are you unhappy?

26:40.230 --> 26:43.190
Don't you like her anymore because you've got what you want?

26:43.550 --> 26:44.926
If that's the case,

26:44.950 --> 26:45.556
I'll...

26:45.580 --> 26:49.050
You two gentlemen have saved Liansheng House.

26:49.820 --> 26:52.940
I thank you on behalf of all the girls.

26:59.280 --> 27:01.400
Mr. Yun, you are an amazing gambler.

27:01.850 --> 27:04.300
I'm glad you are the new owner of Liansheng House.

27:04.950 --> 27:06.510
I'm flattered.

27:06.800 --> 27:08.250
Menglan.

27:11.520 --> 27:14.270
I don't know how to thank you.

27:14.450 --> 27:15.906
I prepared some wine.

27:15.930 --> 27:17.840
Please go upstairs and enjoy.

27:19.860 --> 27:20.876
Am I invited too?

27:20.900 --> 27:22.890
Of course.

27:51.580 --> 27:52.616
Miss Ke,

27:52.640 --> 27:54.486
this is now my place as well.

27:54.510 --> 27:55.960
You don't have to follow me.

27:56.230 --> 27:58.080
I want to show Jin around.

27:59.620 --> 28:01.070
Please go ahead.

28:02.450 --> 28:03.900
Go.

28:28.510 --> 28:32.420
I have something to tell you.

28:33.030 --> 28:34.480
Please.

28:40.810 --> 28:43.100
Menglan. Menglan.

28:43.700 --> 28:46.770
Why are you not as close to me as before?

28:48.160 --> 28:51.206
If I made you misunderstand in the past,

28:51.230 --> 28:53.190
it was my fault.

28:53.750 --> 28:55.710
I thank you very much

28:55.830 --> 28:59.040
for buying Liansheng House.

28:59.430 --> 29:01.786
I'll do my best to work for you in the future.

29:01.810 --> 29:02.906
That's all.

29:02.930 --> 29:04.590
I hope you can understand.

29:04.730 --> 29:06.180
Why?

29:06.220 --> 29:07.936
Why are you confused?

29:07.960 --> 29:11.046
If some Mr. Zhang or Mr. Liu bought this place,

29:11.070 --> 29:13.790
should I offer myself as well?

29:14.210 --> 29:16.006
Is this a business regulation

29:16.030 --> 29:17.406
or any unspoken rule?

29:17.430 --> 29:19.280
But I'm not them.

29:29.090 --> 29:30.540
Menglan.

29:31.420 --> 29:33.046
I never asked you before.

29:33.070 --> 29:34.730
I'll ask you only once.

29:34.800 --> 29:36.460
Do you like me?

29:40.480 --> 29:44.060
Love in the world, in very rare cases,

29:44.240 --> 29:46.190
is as firm as a rock.

29:46.480 --> 29:49.310
Most of the time, it's like a floating cloud.

29:50.090 --> 29:51.820
Don't bother yourself with it.

29:51.980 --> 29:53.430
Menglan.

29:57.080 --> 29:58.556
You don't have to trust others.

29:58.580 --> 29:59.586
But can you trust me?

29:59.610 --> 30:01.150
Please let go of me.

30:03.670 --> 30:05.120
Miss Shu.

30:09.220 --> 30:10.670
You're back.

30:10.960 --> 30:12.480
I'll go with you.

30:21.100 --> 30:24.220
We accidentally entered that inn.

30:24.540 --> 30:26.930
There were soldiers outside and bandits inside.

30:27.330 --> 30:29.836
It was a mess. Sabers, swords, and arrows.

30:29.860 --> 30:31.810
But with your martial skills,

30:32.330 --> 30:34.130
you should be able to get out.

30:34.890 --> 30:36.430
Of course.

30:38.700 --> 30:41.586
But the two young men who were with me couldn't.

30:41.610 --> 30:43.476
We were there together.

30:43.500 --> 30:46.466
How could I escape on my own?

30:46.490 --> 30:47.816
Right?

30:47.840 --> 30:49.640
Here, fill it up for me.

30:50.430 --> 30:52.550
I'm captivated by the story. Sorry.

30:52.570 --> 30:54.020
It doesn't matter.

30:54.450 --> 30:56.770
I told them,

30:57.090 --> 30:58.540
"Guys,

30:58.700 --> 31:01.050
there's only one way out today.

31:01.090 --> 31:04.470
Let's swim out of this latrine."

31:05.460 --> 31:07.270
Then we swam out.

31:08.530 --> 31:09.646
What are you talking about?

31:09.670 --> 31:11.266
If it's a joke, tell it again.

31:11.290 --> 31:12.836
Perfect timing.

31:12.860 --> 31:14.356
Jin is sharing one of his experiences.

31:14.380 --> 31:15.930
-He once... -Shut up.

31:16.550 --> 31:18.106
How can you tell this to Miss Ke?

31:18.130 --> 31:20.160
It's too rude for girls.

31:23.320 --> 31:25.586
I don't know what kind of joke it is,

31:25.610 --> 31:27.890
but this is the first time

31:28.300 --> 31:29.940
that I have seen Tianhu smile like this.

31:36.820 --> 31:38.270
Miss Ke,

31:38.590 --> 31:40.470
this toast is for you.

31:40.860 --> 31:41.996
We hit it off.

31:42.020 --> 31:44.176
I'll help you

31:44.200 --> 31:45.650
if anyone comes to make trouble.

31:45.720 --> 31:47.096
Thank you.

31:47.120 --> 31:50.120
With Mr. Yun as the owner of Liansheng House,

31:52.610 --> 31:55.000
I'm sure everything will go smoothly in the future.

31:55.180 --> 31:56.820
Cheers.

32:12.860 --> 32:16.366
The dulcet music and the bright moon.

32:16.390 --> 32:18.306
How beautiful!

32:18.330 --> 32:19.990
Such scenery is priceless.

32:20.060 --> 32:21.766
A wonderful picture on such a lovely night.

32:21.790 --> 32:23.396
But it seems to be a pity

32:23.420 --> 32:25.010
without a beauty by your side.

32:25.150 --> 32:26.600
You're wrong.

32:27.580 --> 32:29.570
You said it

32:30.710 --> 32:32.370
in a too flippant manner.

32:33.010 --> 32:34.980
There are so many injustices in the world.

32:35.030 --> 32:38.060
Sad love life is not a big deal.

32:40.490 --> 32:42.296
I feel sad for you, in fact.

32:42.320 --> 32:43.960
Look at you.

32:44.340 --> 32:45.790
You don't have...

32:46.020 --> 32:47.206
Your heart is stone.

32:47.230 --> 32:49.886
Do you know

32:49.910 --> 32:51.520
why Miss Ke is keeping a distance from you?

32:52.200 --> 32:54.226
You're not an open-hearted person.

32:54.250 --> 32:55.736
You have so many secrets.

32:55.760 --> 32:59.880
But there are things only you can see through.

33:02.300 --> 33:04.836
Maybe I can even provide solutions.

33:04.860 --> 33:06.370
I do have one thing on my mind.

33:06.880 --> 33:08.680
Can you keep it a secret for me?

33:11.750 --> 33:13.950
My sister is willing to help Menglan be a commoner.

33:14.860 --> 33:17.866
She also agreed that I can marry Menglan.

33:17.890 --> 33:20.320
Under what conditions?

33:21.130 --> 33:22.740
She asked me to learn to do business

33:22.950 --> 33:25.020
and take over the family business.

33:34.830 --> 33:38.460
This problem can be solved.

33:40.610 --> 33:42.090
Can you

33:42.690 --> 33:43.896
help Menglan change her status

33:43.920 --> 33:45.056
without the help of my sister?

33:45.080 --> 33:48.310
To do that, you need connections in the Music Department.

33:48.760 --> 33:51.226
As the big boss of the gambling industry in Nandu,

33:51.250 --> 33:53.286
Tang Xiao definitely has the connections you want.

33:53.310 --> 33:54.790
You want to ask Tang Xiao for help?

33:55.170 --> 33:57.060
You're walking straight into a lion's den.

33:58.040 --> 34:00.346
He wanted Menglan to be his concubine

34:00.370 --> 34:01.976
if he made Menglan a commoner.

34:02.000 --> 34:03.776
The conditions are negotiable.

34:03.800 --> 34:05.250
Mr. Su.

34:05.780 --> 34:07.250
If you trust me,

34:07.340 --> 34:09.310
why don't you leave it to me?

34:09.629 --> 34:12.060
[Cao Sect]

34:23.069 --> 34:26.240
[Su's Silk Warehouse]

34:44.080 --> 34:46.689
[Yufeng Warehouse]

35:02.340 --> 35:03.790
Here.

35:19.180 --> 35:22.820
Fire! Fire!

35:22.820 --> 35:24.780
Help!

35:25.840 --> 35:27.426
Actually, I've come up with an idea.

35:27.450 --> 35:29.640
But I still need an opportunity.

35:34.910 --> 35:36.660
Flames there are shooting up.

35:36.890 --> 35:38.740
There seems to be a lot of flammable things.

35:42.200 --> 35:43.650
This direction...

35:44.390 --> 35:45.840
That's my family's silk warehouse.
